  "paragraphs": [
    {
      "id": "17:p0",
      "kind": "heading",
      "text": "$t1 == '17'?\r\n`",
      "sourceLocation": "txt:chars:5358:5373"
    },
    {
      "id": "17:p1",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "\r\n",
      "sourceLocation": "txt:chars:5373:5375"
    },
    {
      "id": "17:p2",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "你的汉堡肉要煎到什么程度？”\r\n",
      "sourceLocation": "txt:chars:5375:5391"
    },
    {
      "id": "17:p3",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "“呃。半熟吧，我想。”\r\n",
      "sourceLocation": "txt:chars:5391:5404"
    },
    {
      "id": "17:p4",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "“好，谢谢。”\r\n",
      "sourceLocation": "txt:chars:5404:5413"
    },
    {
      "id": "17:p5",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "你呆在厨房里。查理漫无目的地转了转，然后走过去一屁股坐在床上。“我很开心我们来了这里。”\r\n",
      "sourceLocation": "txt:chars:5413:5459"
    },
    {
      "id": "17:p6",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "“我也是。”\r\n",
      "sourceLocation": "txt:chars:5459:5467"
    },
    {
      "id": "17:p7",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "“我觉得确实是对我们有好处，你说呢？”\r\n",
      "sourceLocation": "txt:chars:5467:5488"
    },
    {
      "id": "17:p8",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "“是啊。”\r\n",
      "sourceLocation": "txt:chars:5488:5495"
    },
    {
      "id": "17:p9",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "“就像奥布莱恩医生和我们说的一样，”查理盯着电视屏幕上小屋变形的倒影，“远离一切，只关注我们自己，这样真好。我感觉真的很治愈……”\r\n",
      "sourceLocation": "txt:chars:5495:5562"
    },
    {
      "id": "17:p10",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "在记录表上勾选 心碎。\r\n",
      "sourceLocation": "txt:chars:5562:5575"
    },
    {
      "id": "17:p11",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "要聊聊明天的计划，转到 18。\r\n",
      "sourceLocation": "txt:chars:5575:5592"
    },
    {
      "id": "17:p12",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "要安慰查理，转到 15。\r\n",
      "sourceLocation": "txt:chars:5592:5606"
    }
  ]
}
